@startuml UC004_Visitor_CV_Access_Sequence
!theme plain
title UC004 — View the profile and preview or download the PDF

actor "Visitor" as Visitor
participant "src/server.js" as Server
participant "src/routes/cv.routes.js" as Routes
participant "src/services/cvService.js" as Service
participant "src/services/cvStorage.js" as Storage
participant "src/db/database.js" as Data
database PostgreSQL as DB

Visitor -> Server : GET /api/profiles/:publicId
Server -> Routes : Dispatch public request
Routes -> Service : Load saved profile
Service -> Data : Find profile by public ID
Data -> DB : Read profile and CV availability
Data --> Service : Saved profile
Service --> Routes : Public fields
Routes --> Visitor : 200 OK with profile

note over Visitor
  public/js/cv.js displays the saved About, Experience,
  Education, Skills, and Contact tabs.
  Switching tabs uses the profile already loaded.
end note

Visitor -> Server : GET /api/profiles/:publicId/cv (optional download=1)
Server -> Routes : Dispatch public PDF request
Routes -> Service : Get PDF for profile
Service -> Data : Resolve current attachment for profile
Data -> DB : Read attachment metadata
Data --> Service : Object key and filename
Service -> Storage : Open PDF
Storage --> Service : PDF stream
Service --> Routes : Stream and filename
Routes --> Visitor : 200 OK with inline or downloadable PDF
@enduml
